### POST /api/auth/signup

**Purpose:** Register new user

**Request:**
```typescript
{
  email: string;
  password: string;
  user_metadata: {
    name: string;
    is_qr_superadmin: 0 | 1;
    is_qr_admin: 0 | 1;
